1
00:00:02,051 --> 00:00:04,636
Welcome to The Expanse, season one.

2
00:00:04,656 --> 00:00:06,536
It's the twenty-third century.

3
00:00:06,556 --> 00:00:08,861
Earth is crowded and powerful.

4
00:00:08,881 --> 00:00:11,171
Mars is a young military power,

5
00:00:11,191 --> 00:00:14,116
slowly turning its red deserts green.

6
00:00:14,226 --> 00:00:16,281
And Belters mine the asteroids,

7
00:00:16,301 --> 00:00:18,231
tired of being pushed around.

8
00:00:18,251 --> 00:00:20,331
Nobody trusts anybody.

9
00:00:20,351 --> 00:00:22,256
Three stories start far apart,

10
00:00:22,276 --> 00:00:24,201
and by the end, they collide.

11
00:00:24,221 --> 00:00:25,499
Spoilers ahead!

12
00:00:26,248 --> 00:00:28,333
Story one: the Canterbury.

13
00:00:28,353 --> 00:00:29,833
Jim Holden is an officer

14
00:00:29,853 --> 00:00:30,818
on an ice hauler,

15
00:00:30,838 --> 00:00:32,718
carrying water from Saturn's rings

16
00:00:32,738 --> 00:00:34,993
to thirsty stations in the Belt.

17
00:00:35,013 --> 00:00:37,193
Out here, water is life.

18
00:00:37,213 --> 00:00:38,703
One day, the crew answers

19
00:00:38,723 --> 00:00:39,553
a distress call

20
00:00:39,573 --> 00:00:42,028
from a drifting ship called the Scopuli.

21
00:00:42,048 --> 00:00:43,303
It's a trap.

22
00:00:43,323 --> 00:00:45,403
Mystery ships destroy the Canterbury,

23
00:00:45,423 --> 00:00:47,053
and only five people escape

24
00:00:47,073 --> 00:00:48,078
in a shuttle:

25
00:00:48,098 --> 00:00:50,248
Holden, Naomi, Amos,

26
00:00:50,268 --> 00:00:51,554
Alex, and Shed.

27
00:00:52,281 --> 00:00:53,936
Holden finds a Martian part

28
00:00:53,956 --> 00:00:55,561
on the trap and blames Mars

29
00:00:55,581 --> 00:00:57,186
on an open broadcast,

30
00:00:57,206 --> 00:00:58,911
and the Belt erupts.

31
00:00:58,931 --> 00:00:59,886
A Martian warship,

32
00:00:59,906 --> 00:01:01,606
the Donnager, picks them up,

33
00:01:01,626 --> 00:01:02,731
then gets destroyed

34
00:01:02,751 --> 00:01:04,806
by the same stealthy ships.

35
00:01:04,826 --> 00:01:05,706
The crew escapes

36
00:01:05,726 --> 00:01:07,106
in a small Martian ship,

37
00:01:07,126 --> 00:01:10,456
the Tachi, and renames it the Rocinante.

38
00:01:10,476 --> 00:01:11,981
At Tycho Station,

39
00:01:12,001 --> 00:01:14,741
Fred Johnson of the Outer Planets Alliance,

40
00:01:14,761 --> 00:01:18,520
the OPA, helps them start hunting for answers.

41
00:01:19,269 --> 00:01:21,294
Story two: Ceres.

42
00:01:21,314 --> 00:01:23,369
Detective Joe Miller is a Belter cop

43
00:01:23,389 --> 00:01:24,219
with a battered hat

44
00:01:24,239 --> 00:01:25,644
and a side job:

45
00:01:25,664 --> 00:01:26,819
find Julie Mao,

46
00:01:26,839 --> 00:01:27,869
the runaway daughter

47
00:01:27,889 --> 00:01:29,719
of a rich Earth family.

48
00:01:29,739 --> 00:01:31,094
Ceres is crowded,

49
00:01:31,114 --> 00:01:32,339
thirsty, and tense,

50
00:01:32,359 --> 00:01:34,034
and Miller has seen it all.

51
00:01:34,074 --> 00:01:35,424
But the deeper he digs,

52
00:01:35,444 --> 00:01:37,274
the stranger it gets.

53
00:01:37,294 --> 00:01:39,049
Julie was on the Scopuli,

54
00:01:39,069 --> 00:01:40,424
the same ship that lured

55
00:01:40,444 --> 00:01:41,874
in the Canterbury.

56
00:01:41,894 --> 00:01:43,224
Miller won't drop the case,

57
00:01:43,244 --> 00:01:44,884
so his boss fires him.

58
00:01:45,589 --> 00:01:48,058
Miller follows Julie's trail to Eros,

59
00:01:48,078 --> 00:01:50,134
a busy station in the Belt,

60
00:01:50,154 --> 00:01:52,784
and runs straight into Holden's crew.

61
00:01:52,804 --> 00:01:54,509
The cynic and the idealist make

62
00:01:54,529 --> 00:01:55,909
an odd pair.

63
00:01:55,929 --> 00:01:57,539
Together they find Julie,

64
00:01:57,559 --> 00:01:58,914
but too late.

65
00:01:58,934 --> 00:02:03,209
She was infected by something alien, the protomolecule.

66
00:02:03,319 --> 00:02:04,759
And the company that found it,

67
00:02:04,779 --> 00:02:06,934
Protogen, is about to test it

68
00:02:06,954 --> 00:02:09,117
on everyone aboard Eros.

69
00:02:09,879 --> 00:02:11,909
Story three: Earth.

70
00:02:11,929 --> 00:02:14,659
Chrisjen Avasarala is a top United Nations

71
00:02:14,679 --> 00:02:17,954
official with sharp words and sharper instincts.

72
00:02:18,064 --> 00:02:19,419
She'll work with anyone,

73
00:02:19,439 --> 00:02:20,469
swear at anyone,

74
00:02:20,489 --> 00:02:23,219
and she's always thinking three moves ahead.

75
00:02:23,239 --> 00:02:25,044
While everyone else blames Mars

76
00:02:25,064 --> 00:02:25,919
or the Belt,

77
00:02:25,939 --> 00:02:27,794
she asks a better question:

78
00:02:27,814 --> 00:02:30,044
who actually gains from a war?

79
00:02:30,064 --> 00:02:31,669
She reaches out to Mars through

80
00:02:31,689 --> 00:02:32,544
an old friend,

81
00:02:32,564 --> 00:02:34,561
and the conspiracy pushes back.

82
00:02:35,315 --> 00:02:36,545
Following the money,

83
00:02:36,565 --> 00:02:38,695
Avasarala finds that the stealth ships

84
00:02:38,715 --> 00:02:40,745
were built in Earth's own shipyards

85
00:02:40,765 --> 00:02:42,670
for private contractors.

86
00:02:42,690 --> 00:02:44,270
The attacks on the Canterbury

87
00:02:44,290 --> 00:02:45,770
and the Donnager were designed

88
00:02:45,790 --> 00:02:46,895
to make Earth,

89
00:02:46,915 --> 00:02:49,445
Mars, and the Belt blame each other.

90
00:02:49,465 --> 00:02:52,045
The trail points to Jules-Pierre Mao,

91
00:02:52,065 --> 00:02:56,470
Julie's father, and to her own boss, Sadavir Errinwright.

92
00:02:56,490 --> 00:02:58,535
Someone on Earth wants this war.

93
00:02:59,272 --> 00:03:00,252
In the finale,

94
00:03:00,272 --> 00:03:02,762
Eros falls to the protomolecule,

95
00:03:02,782 --> 00:03:04,087
and Holden and Miller fight

96
00:03:04,107 --> 00:03:06,557
their way back to the Rocinante.

97
00:03:06,622 --> 00:03:08,537
The crew has become a family,

98
00:03:08,557 --> 00:03:10,062
Miller has a new purpose,

99
00:03:10,082 --> 00:03:12,887
and Avasarala knows who her enemies are.

100
00:03:12,907 --> 00:03:15,162
Three stories, one conspiracy,

101
00:03:15,182 --> 00:03:16,962
and a solar system that will never

102
00:03:16,982 --> 00:03:18,337
be the same.

103
00:03:18,357 --> 00:03:20,388
Next up: season two.

